SUMMARY:DevOps Foundations for the AI Agentic Era
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nIn this session we will start by ex
 amining why a strong DevOps culture and tooling are more critical than eve
 r in the age of autonomous coding and operations agents. Modern AI “Dev
 ” agents (like GitHub Copilot that can generate code or tests) and AI Op
 s agents (like Azure’s SRE reliability agent) are poised to accelerate s
 oftware delivery.\n\n🔗 [DevOps Engineer Spotlight Collection](https://w
 ww.microsoft.com/en-us/thesource-developer/Category/Group/86/devops-engine
 er-spotlight-collection/?wt.mc_id=meetup_27135_webpage_reactor)\n🔗 [The
 Source Developer Ehub](https://aka.ms/TheSource/DeveloperEHub/r)\n\n📍
  This session is a part of a series. [Learn more here!](https://developer.
 microsoft.com/reactor/series/S-1674/?wt.mc_id=meetup_27135_webpage_reactor
 )
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/microsoft-reactor-toronto/events/3148
 79436/
